    "summary_one_sentence": "An out-of-work accountant's quiet afternoon with a stay-at-home dad devolves into a chaotic fight for survival when the duo is suddenly targeted by deadly mercenaries.",
    "summary_short": "Brian, an unemployed accountant looking forward to a relaxing afternoon, joins stay-at-home father Jeff for a playdate with their young sons. The ordinary playdate takes a wild turn when a group of armed mercenaries ambushes them without warning. Completely out of his element, Brian must dodge bullets and navigate a series of increasingly ridiculous obstacles to protect the kids. Together, the mismatched dads must rely on quick thinking and unexpected teamwork to outsmart their pursuers.",
    "summary_long": "Brian is an out-of-work accountant struggling to adapt to his new routine when he connects with Jeff, a seasoned stay-at-home dad who seems to have fatherhood completely figured out. Eager for some adult conversation and a laid-back afternoon, Brian agrees to bring their sons together for a routine playdate. The quiet suburban day is abruptly shattered when heavily armed mercenaries crash the meeting, targeting the dads for reasons Brian cannot comprehend. Thrust into absolute chaos, Brian finds himself fleeing for his life alongside Jeff, who proves surprisingly resilient under fire. As they navigate a high-stakes escape across town, Brian is forced to face one ridiculous, life-threatening obstacle after another with zero tactical training. The contrast between Brian's risk-averse nature and the escalating violence creates a series of comedic yet perilous encounters. Between dodging gunfire in local playgrounds and commandeering unexpected getaway vehicles, the two fathers struggle to keep their children safe while staying one step ahead of a relentless enemy. Along the way, Brian learns to tap into a newfound resourcefulness, transforming from an anxious desk worker into an improbable action hero. Ultimately, the duo must pool their unique skill sets—combining Brian's analytical mind with Jeff's unpredictable street smarts—to unravel why they were targeted and survive the most insane playdate of their lives.",
